{"id":6181,"date":"2024-01-31T05:10:11","date_gmt":"2024-01-31T05:10:11","guid":{"rendered":"http:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/?p=6181"},"modified":"2026-07-27T07:45:08","modified_gmt":"2026-07-27T07:45:08","slug":"digital-marketing-roles-responsibilities","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/digital-marketing-roles-responsibilities\/","title":{"rendered":"Digital Marketing Job Roles and Responsibilities: 2026 Guide"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<p>Anyone who wants to make a <a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/career-in-digital-marketing\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">career in digital marketing<\/a> must know what a common job responsibilities for digital marketing looks like. It helps you build a strong and impressive resume that stands out and prepares you for the interview better.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>An ideal digital marketing job description outlines everything that the employer expects from a skilled digital marketer. It specifies the nature of the job, skills required, duties, responsibilities, and other criteria. Moreover, the primary focus is managing marketing projects and campaigns across multiple platforms and handling client requirements.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>There are different specializations in digital marketing, such as social media marketing, <a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/what-is-seo\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">SEO<\/a>, &nbsp;<a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/what-is-email-marketing-how-does-it-work\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">email marketing<\/a>, <a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/content-marketing\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">content marketing<\/a>, <a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/what-is-ppc\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">PPC<\/a>, etc. Each has different roles and responsibilities for every professional, which can vary according to the company and team. Their job profile may include preparing reports, running campaigns, conducting regular audits, tracking and measuring results, etc.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>In this blog, we will discuss the responsibilities of different job roles depending on the positioning in digital marketing and other details required to be a digital marketer.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Who is a Digital Marketer?<\/strong><\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p>A digital marketer promotes products, services, and brands via digital platforms, such as social media, websites, emails, mobile apps, etc. They employ several technologies and tools to connect with the <a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/target-audience\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">target audience<\/a> online and zero in on the best <a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/digital-marketing-strategy\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">digital marketing strategy<\/a> to meet the business goals.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>Irrespective of a job position in digital marketing, these specialists hold expertise in pay-per-click, search engine optimization, social media marketing, email marketing, content marketing, and more. Also, they are responsible for budget management, data analysis, campaign tracking, and other aspects of digital marketing.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Growth of Digital Marketing Jobs<\/strong><\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p>The demand for digital marketers has shot up in recent years, especially after the pandemic when many businesses embraced digital platforms and the Internet. With the ever-rising importance of the online presence of businesses and brands, companies are looking for competent marketers to handle their projects and accelerate business growth. This has led to a rapid increase in job opportunities for freshers and experienced professionals.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>India alone is expected to generate around 20 lakh jobs in the field, with a growth of 27.4% by 2026. So, for anyone aspiring to make a career in digital marketing, it\u2019s the perfect time to get started.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n    <!-- LOTTIE SCRIPT -->\n    <script src=\"https:\/\/unpkg.com\/@lottiefiles\/lottie-player@latest\/dist\/lottie-player.js\"><\/script>\n\n    <section class=\"wscube-courses mb-2\">\n        <div class=\"container\">\n            <h3 class=\"mb-4\">Recommended Professional <\/br> Certificates<\/h3>\n\n            <div class=\"owl-carousel courseOwl\">\n\n                \n                    \n                    <div class=\"course-card card-r rounded-4\">\n\n                        <!-- \u2705 SINGLE MEDIA DIV (FIXED) -->\n                        <div class=\"course-media\"\n                             data-lottie=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/uploads\/images\/courses\/json-images\/digital-marketing.json\"\n                             data-fallback=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/themes\/newwscube\/assets\/imges\/Image.png\">\n                        <\/div>\n\n                        <div class=\"card-body\">\n                            <h5>AI-Powered Digital Marketing Course<\/h5>\n\n                            <p class=\"rating\">\n                                4.9 \u2605\u2605\u2605\u2605\u2605\n                                (19476)\n                            <\/p>\n\n                            <ul class=\"course-meta\">\n                                <li>\ud83d\udc64 20000 Learners<\/li>\n                                <li>\u23f1 20 Weeks<\/li>\n                            <\/ul>\n\n                            <div class=\"mt-3\">\n                                                                    <a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/digital-marketing-course?utm_source=WsBlog&#038;utm_medium=blog_course_slider&#038;utm_campaign=SEO\"\n                                       target=\"_blank\"\n                                       class=\"btn view-btn btn-sm\">\n             